<title>AUSTRIA: Austrian January wholesale prices up 0.9 pct y/y.</title>
<headline>Austrian January wholesale prices up 0.9 pct y/y.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA 1997-02-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Central Statistics Office reported the following economic indicator details.</p>
<p> AUSTRIAN WHOLESALE PRICES    JAN*	 DEC	  JAN 1996</p>
<p> Monthly WPI index rise	 0.4*	 0.3	     0.8</p>
<p> Yr-on-yr rise		    0.9*	 1.3	    -0.4</p>
<p> Index (base 1986)	    100.4*     104.4	   103.9</p>
<p>* provisional data, base 1996=100</p>
<p>The statistical office recalculates the base index every 10 years. All data beginning with January 1997 onwards will be calculated using the year average of the index in 1996, which is set at 100.</p>
<p>-- Vienna newsroom, +431 531 12 254</p>
</text>
